{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27810","headline":"亚夫碎玉斗 · 裴夷直","name":"亚夫碎玉斗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雄谋竟不决，宝玉终不爱。\n倏尔霜刃挥，飒然春冰碎。\n飞光动旗帜，散响惊环佩。\n霜洒绣障前，星流锦筵内。\n图王业已失，爲虏言空悔。\n独有青史中，英风观千载。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴夷直","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27810.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27810","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}